# Ruling 2020-09-25: a legal target that is not destroyed (Darksteel Citadel is indestructible) still lets its controller
# search for a basic land card, and you still draw. Bot2 keeps the Citadel and gains a tapped Forest.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mountain
Cleansing Wildfire
Mountain x4
Mountain x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Darksteel Citadel
Island x8
Forest
Island x8

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Darksteel Citadel.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Cleansing Wildfire.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Darksteel Citadel)
Bot2.Accept
Bot2.Search(Forest)

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot2.Battlefield = Darksteel Citadel; Forest
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Tapped = true
Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
